ormat%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cfe74d9b7270cb8db2823bcbc919835d, https://si.imgix.net/31c7aa49/uploads/origins/7a096244-ab88-4cf8-9d59-0a744cb1e29a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ae637092a7a561a5d9a93e882208b211 2x, https://si.imgix.net/31c7aa49/uploads/origins/7a096244-ab88-4cf8-9d59-0a744cb1e29a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2ae2ddcd6d41e132e969bb68fd7fd62f 3x"}, "body": "Hello!\nI need a character drawn for a friend of mine! She is a pink Tasmanian Devil. it is posed leaning foward, also with a wink and making a peace sign with one hand. The ears are in the shape of bats. The rest of the background and other details is up to you! If possible, it would be great if you could sign it \"Happy Birthday, Sweet.\"\n\nSweet's Refences: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15YhNhhnQ3FOWiJpU-NRoMtPu--dj5mEH?usp=sharing\n\nこんにちは！\n私の友人のためにキャラクターを描いて欲しいのです！ピンクのタスマニアデビルで、前傾姿勢で、ウインクをして、片手でピースサインをしています。耳はコウモリの形をしています。あとは背景など細かい部分はお任せします！可能であれば、\"Happy Birthday, Sweet \"とサインしていただけると嬉しいです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15YhNhhnQ3FOWiJpU-NRoMtPu--dj5mEH?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@matsuitomato/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1722521, "client_id": 2902294, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6269df04/uploads/origins/d09afae0-e9be-4cb4-8a0a-62cd0008a3f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3bf8aa79e788960d975834c92fb48578", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6269df04/uploads/origins/d09afae0-e9be-4cb4-8a0a-62cd0008a3f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3bf8aa79e788960d975834c92fb48578, https://si.imgix.net/6269df04/uploads/origins/d09afae0-e9be-4cb4-8a